              "value": "You are an expert at summarizing security roles in different languages.\n\nSummarize the following role in no more than {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.numWords}} words.  \nStart your summary with:\"{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.roleName}} grants access to \".\nTranslate your response appropriately in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.outputLang}}.\nIf you need to translate, only keep {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.roleName}} in its original form.\nIf you need to translate, make sure to also translate \"grants access to \" as well.\n\nRole name: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.roleName}}\nList of privileges:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.privilegeList}}"
